<%- include('../partials/admin-header') %><div class="settings-tabs"><a href="#business">Business</a><a href="#security">Security</a><a href="#messages">Messages</a><a href="#demo">Demo data</a></div><div class="settings-admin-grid"><div><form id="business" class="panel form-stack" method="post"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Business settings</h2><p>Used throughout the public website.</p></div></div><div class="form-grid"><label class="field"><span>Company name</span><input name="company_name" value="<%= settings.company_name %>" required></label><label class="field"><span>Business email</span><input type="email" name="business_email" value="<%= settings.business_email %>" required></label><label class="field"><span>Business phone</span><input name="business_phone" value="<%= settings.business_phone||'' %>" placeholder="Not configured"></label><label class="field"><span>Service area</span><input name="service_area" value="<%= settings.service_area %>" required></label><label class="field"><span>Operating hours</span><input name="operating_hours" value="<%= settings.operating_hours %>"></label><label class="field"><span>Currency</span><select name="currency"><option selected>INR</option></select></label><label class="field full"><span>Booking notice</span><textarea name="booking_notice" rows="3"><%= settings.booking_notice %></textarea></label></div><fieldset class="checkbox-group"><legend>Notification preferences</legend><label><input type="checkbox" name="email_notifications" <%= settings.email_notifications?'checked':'' %>> Email notifications</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="whatsapp_notifications" <%= settings.whatsapp_notifications?'checked':'' %>> WhatsApp notifications</label><p>Preferences do not activate delivery. External credentials and provider integration are still required.</p></fieldset><button class="button" type="submit">Save settings</button></form><section id="messages" class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Recent contact messages</h2><p>Saved from the public support form</p></div></div><div class="message-list"><% messages.forEach(m=>{ %><details><summary><strong><%= m.subject %></strong><span><%= m.name %> · <%= h.formatDate(m.created_at) %></span></summary><p><%= m.message %></p><small><%= m.email %> <%= m.phone?'· '+m.phone:'' %></small></details><% }) %><% if(!messages.length){ %><p class="muted">No contact messages.</p><% } %></div></section></div><aside><form id="security" class="panel form-stack" method="post" action="/admin/settings/password"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><h2>Administrator password</h2><p>Change the signed-in administrator’s password.</p><label class="field"><span>Current password</span><input type="password" name="current_password" required autocomplete="current-password"></label><label class="field"><span>New password</span><input type="password" name="new_password" required minlength="10" autocomplete="new-password"></label><button class="button button-block" type="submit">Change password</button></form><div class="panel integration-panel"><h2>Integration status</h2><div><span>Email delivery</span><strong class="status-badge status-new">Not configured</strong></div><div><span>WhatsApp</span><strong class="status-badge status-new">Not configured</strong></div><div><span>Online payments</span><strong class="status-badge status-new">Not configured</strong></div><div><span>Google Maps</span><strong class="status-badge status-new">Not configured</strong></div><p>No delivery, payment or map is claimed while credentials are absent.</p></div><form id="demo" class="panel danger-panel form-stack confirm-form" method="post" action="/admin/settings/reset-demo" data-confirm="Reset all demonstration bookings, quotations, reviews and technicians? Real customer records are preserved."><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><h2>Reset demonstration data</h2><p>Recreates the fictional sample records used for live demonstrations. Real customer records are not deleted.</p><label class="field"><span>Type RESET DEMO</span><input name="confirm" autocomplete="off"></label><button class="button button-danger button-block" type="submit">Reset demo records</button></form></aside></div><%- include('../partials/admin-footer') %>